<template>
 <div v-back="{active:true,close:()=>!busy&&$emit('close')}" class="magic-backdrop" @click.self="!busy&&$emit('close')">
  <section ref="dialog" class="magic-panel" role="dialog" @keydown.tab="trapFocus" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="magic-title" data-magic-panel>
   <header><div class="magic-emblem" aria-hidden="true">✧</div><div><small>{{ panel.mode==='casino'?'CASINO DE BLANCHECIME':panel.mode==='rotom'?'UN DRÔLE D’APPAREIL':'ÎLE MAGIQUE' }}</small><h2 id="magic-title">{{ title }}</h2></div><button class="magic-close" :disabled="busy" aria-label="Fermer" @click="$emit('close')">×</button></header>
   <main>
    <template v-if="['travel','return'].includes(panel.mode)"><div class="magic-boat" aria-hidden="true">⛵</div><p>{{ panel.mode==='travel'?'Mon bateau rejoint un petit village perché sur un rocher. Le passage coûte 20 000 ₽. Tu embarques ?':'Prêt pour le retour ? Je te ramène sur l’île du Dark Continent.' }}</p><p class="magic-hint">Le Module Vol ne permet pas de rejoindre l’Île Magique. Le bateau assure le retour.</p><button class="magic-primary" :disabled="busy||panel.mode==='travel'&&state.money<20000" @click="send('travel',{direction:panel.mode==='travel'?'out':'return'})">{{ panel.mode==='travel'?'Embarquer · 20 000 ₽':'Retourner au Dark Continent' }}</button></template>
    <template v-else-if="panel.mode==='casino'"><p>Tu veux jouer avec moi ? J’ai caché un trésor. Si tu as de la chance, il est pour toi !</p><div class="magic-stat"><b>1 chance sur 50</b><span>Une Master Ball à gagner · un essai gratuit par jour.</span></div><p v-if="state.casinoPlayed" class="magic-hint">On a déjà joué aujourd’hui. Reviens demain !</p><button class="magic-primary" :disabled="busy||state.casinoPlayed" @click="send('casino')">{{ state.casinoPlayed?'Déjà joué aujourd’hui':'Oui, jouer gratuitement' }}</button></template>
    <template v-else-if="panel.mode==='craft'"><p>Mes Balls n’apprivoisent que les créatures de leur type : <b>30 % de réussite</b>, même si elles ont deux types. Elles ne fonctionnent que sur le Dark Continent, jamais sur les Élites.</p><div class="magic-types"><button v-for="(label,t) in panel.types" :key="t" :style="typeStyle(t)" :aria-pressed="type===t" @click="type=t">{{ label }}</button></div><label class="magic-quantity">Nombre de Balls<input v-model.number="quantity" type="number" min="1" max="99"></label><div class="magic-recipe"><div v-for="r in recipe" :key="r.key" :class="{missing:stock(r.key)<r.quantity}"><bag-item-icon :pocket="r.key.startsWith('dark_plate_')?'key':'treasures'" :item-key="r.key"/><span>{{ resourceName(r.key) }}<small>{{ number(stock(r.key)) }} disponibles</small></span><b>×{{ number(r.quantity) }}</b></div></div><button class="magic-primary" :disabled="busy||!canCraft" @click="send('craft',{type,quantity})">Fabriquer {{ quantity }} Ball{{ quantity>1?'s':'' }} · {{ panel.types[type] }}</button><p class="magic-hint">Après capture : espèce, niveau et K conservés ; nouveaux IV aléatoires et zéro EV. Chaque Ball est consommée au lancer.</p></template>
    <template v-else-if="panel.mode==='module'"><p>J’ai récupéré un drôle de module. Je ne te dirai qu’une chose : il changera ta vie.</p><div class="magic-stat"><b>2 000 000 ₽</b><span>+ 20 plaques de chacun des 18 types</span></div><div class="magic-plate-grid"><span v-for="(label,t) in panel.types" :key="t" :class="{missing:stock('dark_plate_'+t.toLowerCase())<20}">{{label}} <b>{{Math.min(20,stock('dark_plate_'+t.toLowerCase()))}}/20</b></span></div><button class="magic-primary" :disabled="busy||state.speed.owned||!canBuyModule" @click="send('purchaseModule')">{{state.speed.owned?'Module déjà obtenu':'Accepter le marché'}}</button></template>
    <template v-else-if="panel.mode==='expedition'">
     <template v-if="state.expedition"><span class="magic-tag">EXPÉDITION EN COURS</span><h3>{{ expeditionTitle }}</h3><div class="magic-selected"><div v-for="p in state.expedition.pokemon" :key="p.uuid"><img :src="$pokemonSprite({...p,data:{id:p.id}})" alt=""><span>{{p.name}}<small>N.{{p.level}} · K{{p.k}}</small></span></div></div><div class="magic-stat"><b>{{remaining}}</b><span>{{state.expedition.ready?'Tes compagnons sont rentrés.':'Tes compagnons ne peuvent pas revenir avant la fin du décompte.'}}</span></div><button class="magic-primary" :disabled="busy||!state.expedition.ready" @click="send('claimExpedition')">Récupérer les Pokémon et le butin</button></template>
     <template v-else-if="result?.rewards"><h3>De retour au village</h3><p>Tes compagnons ont retrouvé leur place dans ton équipe ou au PC.</p><div class="magic-stat"><b>{{number(result.rewards.money)}} ₽</b><span>Récompense de l’expédition</span></div><ul class="magic-reward"><li v-for="(n,key) in result.rewards.items" v-show="n" :key="key">{{resourceName(key)}} <b>×{{number(n)}}</b></li></ul><button class="magic-primary" @click="$emit('refresh')">Voir la mission du jour</button></template>
     <template v-else><span class="magic-tag">MISSION DU JOUR · {{state.mission.date}}</span><h3>{{state.mission.title}}</h3><blockquote>{{state.mission.hint}}</blockquote><p class="magic-hint">Confie-moi jusqu’à trois compagnons pour <b>12 heures</b>. Leurs types, niveau, potentiel, IV et capacités aideront l’expédition. Garde un Pokémon conscient avec toi.</p><div class="magic-chosen"><button v-for="id in selected" :key="id" @click="toggle(id)"><img :src="$pokemonSprite(pokemon.find(p=>p.uuid===id))" alt=""><span>{{pokemon.find(p=>p.uuid===id)?.name||pokemon.find(p=>p.uuid===id)?.truename}}</span><span aria-hidden="true">×</span></button><span v-if="!selected.length">Choisis de un à trois Pokémon</span></div><div class="magic-filters"><button :aria-pressed="source==='team'" @click="source='team';limit=24">Équipe</button><button :aria-pressed="source==='pc'" @click="source='pc';limit=24">PC</button><input v-model="query" type="search" placeholder="Rechercher…" aria-label="Rechercher un Pokémon"></div><div class="magic-roster"><button v-for="p in filtered.slice(0,limit)" :key="p.uuid" :aria-pressed="selected.includes(p.uuid)" :disabled="busy||p.isEgg||p.currentHp<=0||selected.length>=3&&!selected.includes(p.uuid)" @click="toggle(p.uuid)"><img :src="$pokemonSprite(p)" alt="" loading="lazy"><span>{{p.name||p.truename}}<small>N.{{p.level}} · K{{p.k}}{{p.source==='pc'?' · Boîte '+(p.box+1):''}}</small></span><b>{{selected.includes(p.uuid)?'✓':'+'}}</b></button></div><button v-if="filtered.length>limit" class="magic-more" @click="limit+=24">Voir plus de Pokémon</button><button class="magic-primary" :disabled="busy||!selected.length" @click="send('startExpedition',{uuids:selected,missionKey:state.mission.key,missionDay:state.mission.date})">Confier {{selected.length}} Pokémon · 12 heures</button></template>
    </template>
    <template v-else-if="panel.mode==='rotom'"><div class="magic-rotom"><img :src="$pokemonSprite(panel.pokemon)" alt="Motisma"><span>{{panel.forms[panel.appliance].label}}</span></div><p>Motisma peut prendre possession de cet appareil. Il adoptera son type, ses statistiques et sa capacité : <b>{{moveName(panel.forms[panel.appliance].move)}}</b>.</p><label v-if="needsMoveChoice" class="magic-replace">Capacité à remplacer<select v-model.number="slot"><option v-for="(move,i) in panel.moves" :key="i" :value="i" :disabled="move===panel.protectedMove">{{moveName(move)}}</option></select></label><button class="magic-primary" :disabled="busy||panel.form===panel.appliance" @click="rotom(false)">Prendre la forme {{panel.forms[panel.appliance].label.replace('Motisma ','')}}</button><button v-if="panel.form" class="magic-more" :disabled="busy" @click="rotom(true)">Reprendre la forme normale</button></template>
    <p v-if="notice" class="magic-success" role="status">{{notice}}</p><p v-if="error" class="magic-error" role="alert">{{error}}</p>
   </main><footer><span v-if="state">{{number(state.money)}} ₽</span><span v-if="busy" role="status">Enregistrement…</span><button :disabled="busy" @click="$emit('close')">Fermer</button></footer>
  </section>
 </div>
</template>
<script>
import BagItemIcon from '@/components/menu/BagItemIcon.vue';
import names from '@/data/gameNames.fr.json';
import {typeBadgeStyle} from '@/services/pokemonTypes';
export default{components:{BagItemIcon},props:{panel:Object,items:Array,busy:Boolean,error:String,result:Object,notice:String},data:()=>({type:'Psychic',quantity:1,selected:[],source:'team',query:'',limit:24,clock:Date.now(),slot:0}),computed:{state(){return this.panel.state;},title(){return {travel:'Le passeur du rocher',return:'Le bateau du retour',casino:'Le jeu du trésor',craft:'Le Maître des Balls',module:'Un marché mystérieux',expedition:'Le bureau des expéditions',rotom:'Un nouvel hôte pour Motisma'}[this.panel.mode];},needsMoveChoice(){if(this.panel.mode!=='rotom')return false;const old=this.panel.forms[this.panel.form]?.move;return this.panel.moves.length>=4&&!this.panel.moves.includes(this.panel.forms[this.panel.appliance].move)&&(!old||old===this.panel.protectedMove||!this.panel.moves.includes(old));},pokemon(){return this.panel.pokemon||[];},filtered(){const q=this.query.toLocaleLowerCase();return this.pokemon.filter(p=>p.source===this.source&&(!q||(p.name||p.truename).toLocaleLowerCase().includes(q)));},recipe(){const q=Number.isInteger(this.quantity)?this.quantity:0;return[{key:'dark_plate_'+this.type.toLowerCase(),quantity:2*q},{key:'crystal_shard',quantity:50*q},{key:'clear_crystal',quantity:25*q},{key:'aurora_prism',quantity:4*q}];},canCraft(){return Number.isInteger(this.quantity)&&this.quantity>0&&this.quantity<=99&&this.recipe.every(r=>this.stock(r.key)>=r.quantity);},canBuyModule(){return this.state.money>=2000000&&Object.keys(this.panel.types).every(t=>this.stock('dark_plate_'+t.toLowerCase())>=20);},remaining(){const ms=Math.max(0,this.state.expedition.readyAt-(this.clock+(this._clockOffset||0)));if(!ms)return'Expédition terminée';const minutes=Math.ceil(ms/60000);return `${Math.floor(minutes/60)} h ${String(minutes%60).padStart(2,'0')} min`;},expeditionTitle(){return this.state.expedition.mission===this.state.mission.key?this.state.mission.title:'Expédition au long cours';}},mounted(){this._previousFocus=document.activeElement;this.$nextTick(()=>this.$refs.dialog.querySelector('button:not(:disabled)')?.focus({preventScroll:true}));if(this.panel.mode==='rotom')this.slot=Math.max(0,this.panel.moves.findIndex(m=>m!==this.panel.protectedMove));this._clockOffset=(this.state?.serverNow||Date.now())-Date.now();this._clock=setInterval(()=>{this.clock=Date.now();if(this.state?.expedition&&this.state.expedition.readyAt<=this.clock+this._clockOffset)this.$set(this.state.expedition,'ready',true);},1000);},beforeDestroy(){clearInterval(this._clock);if(this._previousFocus?.isConnected)this._previousFocus.focus({preventScroll:true});},methods:{trapFocus(event){const nodes=[...this.$refs.dialog.querySelectorAll('button:not(:disabled),input:not(:disabled),select:not(:disabled),[tabindex="0"]')].filter(e=>e.offsetParent);const first=nodes[0],last=nodes[nodes.length-1];if(event.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===first){event.preventDefault();last?.focus();}else if(!event.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===last){event.preventDefault();first?.focus();}},number(n){return Number(n||0).toLocaleString('fr-FR');},stock(key){return this.items?.find(i=>i.key===key)?.quantity||0;},resourceName(key){return this.items?.find(i=>i.key===key)?.name||({crystal_shard:'Éclat fissuré',clear_crystal:'Cristal limpide',aurora_prism:'Prisme d’aurore'}[key])||(key.startsWith('dark_plate_')?'Plaque '+this.panel.types[Object.keys(this.panel.types).find(t=>t.toLowerCase()===key.slice(11))]:key);},typeStyle: typeBadgeStyle,moveName(m){return names.moves?.[m]||m;},toggle(id){this.selected=this.selected.includes(id)?this.selected.filter(v=>v!==id):this.selected.length<3?[...this.selected,id]:this.selected;},send(name,data={}){this.$emit('command',name,data);},rotom(reset){this.send('rotom',{appliance:this.panel.appliance,reset,slot:this.slot,expectedUuid:this.panel.pokemon.uuid,expectedMoves:this.panel.moves,expectedForm:this.panel.form});}}};
</script>
